call shallows r=110 deep=5 n=1

# ===== Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest (15 steps) =========================================================
info title=Sargasso Town
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A floating town of lashed-together wrecks in the lagoon of a sunken volcano, its streets made of decks, its council of five captains away for the season. Each left a favour to be done for their vote - win all five and the town's chest is yours.
island on.arrive=message||A ring of black rock, and inside it, on a calm green lagoon, a whole town made of wrecks: hulls roped to hulls, decks for streets, flags and washing lines - and nobody home.

story springwater|Cask of spring water|PlasticBottle_Water|A small cask of sweet water from the crater spring.
story vote|Captain's vote token|quest:Tangaroa_Token|A brass token stamped with a ship: one vote in the Council of Captains.
story pumphandle|Pump handle|quest:Varuna_CraneKey|An iron pump handle out of the scrap barge, near enough the right size.
story spyglass|Fen's spyglass|Binoculars|A brass spyglass with F.F. scratched on it.

note notice Notice of the Council | SARGASSO TOWN - NOTICE OF THE COUNCIL OF CAPTAINS\n\nThe town's chest goes to whoever wins the Council: five votes of five.\n\nThe Council is at sea for the season. Each captain has left a vote token on board - for whoever does them a favour. Read the notes on their ships.\n\nThe ballot box is in the council hulk. Cast all five there.
note mbekinote Captain Mbeki's note | Captain Mbeki - the Hesper, on the weed islet by the quay.\n\nMy water butt is empty and the lagoon's salt. Bring me a cask from the crater spring on the north rim and my vote is yours.
note rourkenote Captain Rourke's note | Rourke - the Galley.\n\nRats. Big ones, the brown sort from the old towns. They've had my galley since spring. Clear them out and you'll find my vote on the stove.
note yusufnote Captain Yusuf's note | Captain Yusuf, nailed to the keel of what used to be the Tamarind.\n\nShe rolled over in a squall. My strongbox is on the bottom under her - air's still trapped under the hull. Bring it up, open it, keep the vote that's in it.
note ilkanote Captain Ilka's note | Ilka - the Merrow, listing.\n\nMy bilge pump's handle snapped and she's filling. There's a handle in the scrap barge that'll do. Fit it, pump her dry, and my vote's in the pump box.
note fennote Captain Fen's note | Fen - the Kittiwake.\n\nLeft my spyglass up in the rim's lookout tower, east side. Can't climb it any more with this knee. Bring it back to the Kittiwake's wheel and I'll give you my vote.
note charter The Council's charter | THE CHARTER OF SARGASSO TOWN\n\n1. No ship sinks while another can hold it up.\n2. Everything is decided by the Council of Captains, five votes of five.\n3. The town's chest belongs to the town - and to whoever the whole Council votes for.\n4. Nobody pays rent. Everybody helps.
note townchest The town chest | Sargasso Town's chest: everybody's savings, the plans for the recycler that turns the town's junk into rope and nails, a captain's hat, dried fish.
loot townchest TradeToken*12;Blueprint_Recycler*1;Hat_Captain*1;Cooked_Herring*3;Rope*4
prop townchest loot.refill=0
prop townchest if.open=signal|voted
prop townchest else.open=message||The town chest is chained to the deck. The charter says: five votes of five.
note rourkechest Rourke's vote, on the stove | On the galley's stove, in a tin: Captain Rourke's vote token, and a ham he'd hidden from the rats.
loot rourkechest story:vote*1;Cooked_GenericMeat*2
prop rourkechest loot.refill=0
prop rourkechest obj.name=rourkechest
prop rourkechest beh.hidden=1
note yusufbox Yusuf's strongbox | Captain Yusuf's strongbox, up from under the Tamarind: his charts, his pipe - and a vote token.
loot yusufbox story:vote*1;TradeToken*3
prop yusufbox loot.refill=0
note scrapbox Scrap barge box | A box on the scrap barge: bolts, a hinge, and an iron pump handle.
loot scrapbox story:pumphandle*1;Bolt*2;Scrap*3
prop scrapbox loot.refill=0
note lookoutbox Lookout's box | A box on the lookout's deck: Fen's spyglass, a stub of pencil and a log of passing ships.
loot lookoutbox story:spyglass*1;Plastic*1
prop lookoutbox loot.refill=0
note fishbarrel Quay fish barrel | A fish barrel on the quay: salt herring.
loot fishbarrel Cooked_Herring*3;Rope*2
prop fishbarrel loot.refill=0
note marketbox Market raft box | A box on the market raft: odds and ends traded and never collected.
loot marketbox Nail*8;Plank*4;Glass*2
prop marketbox loot.refill=0
note sunkcrate Sunk crate | A crate that slipped off a deck between the hulls.
loot sunkcrate MetalOre*2;Scrap*3;Plastic*2
prop sunkcrate loot.refill=0

prop springtap obj.name=springtap
prop springtap beh.use=Fill a cask at the crater spring
prop springtap if.use=!signal|filled
prop springtap on.use=message||Sweet cold water out of the black rock. You fill a little cask to the bung.\ngive||story:springwater*1\nsignal||filled\nsound||event:/char/cup_fill
prop springtap else.use=message||You've filled your cask.
prop mbekibutt obj.name=mbekibutt
prop mbekibutt beh.use=Pour the spring water into Mbeki's water butt
prop mbekibutt if.use=quest|3\ntake|story:springwater|1
prop mbekibutt on.use=message||The butt drinks the cask. Taped inside its lid: a brass token. Mbeki's vote.\ngive||story:vote*1\nsound||event:/char/cup_pour
prop mbekibutt else.use=message||Captain Mbeki's water butt, dry as a bone.
prop rats creature.count=4
prop rats creature.respawn=0
prop rats creature.zone=galley
prop rats on.defeat=show|rourkechest\nmessage||The galley is quiet. On the stove, a tin you hadn't noticed.
prop ilkapump obj.name=ilkapump
prop ilkapump beh.use=Fit the handle and pump the Merrow dry
prop ilkapump if.use=quest|9\ntake|story:pumphandle|1
prop ilkapump on.use=message||The handle fits, more or less. You pump until your arms burn; the bilge water gushes over the side and the Merrow comes upright with a sigh. In the pump box: Ilka's vote.\ngive||story:vote*1\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/waterpump
prop ilkapump else.use=message||Ilka's bilge pump - no handle. Her note says the scrap barge has one.
prop fenwheel obj.name=fenwheel
prop fenwheel beh.use=Hang Fen's spyglass on the Kittiwake's wheel
prop fenwheel if.use=take|story:spyglass|1
prop fenwheel on.use=message||You hang the spyglass on its hook by the wheel. Under the hook, a token: Fen's vote.\ngive||story:vote*1\nsound||event:/ui/pickup
prop fenwheel else.use=message||The Kittiwake's wheel, an empty brass hook beside it.
prop ballotbox obj.name=ballotbox
prop ballotbox beh.use=Cast the five votes
prop ballotbox if.use=quest|14\ntake|story:vote|5
prop ballotbox on.use=message||Five tokens rattle into the box. The council's bell rings by itself in the wind - five votes of five. The town chest's chain drops to the deck.\nsignal||voted\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/bicyclebell
prop ballotbox else.use=message||The ballot box. Five votes of five - read the charter.

prop quay zone.id=quay
prop quay zone.radius=8
prop quay zone.message=Sargasso Town's quay: mooring posts, a notice board, and the town creaking all round you on the water.
prop galley zone.id=galley
prop galley zone.radius=3
prop galley zone.repeat=never
prop galley zone.message=Rourke's galley - and the rats are home. Big brown ones!
prop sunkhull zone.id=sunkhull
prop sunkhull zone.radius=5
prop sunkhull zone.message=Under the Tamarind: dark water, silver air trapped against the hull, and a strongbox on the sand.
prop hullair zone.id=hullair
prop hullair zone.radius=3
prop hullair zone.repeat=1
prop hullair zone.air=1
prop hullbubbles atmo.particles=bubbles
prop hullbubbles zone.radius=3
prop spring zone.id=spring
prop spring zone.radius=5
prop spring zone.message=The crater spring: a tap in the black rock, and the sweetest water on the island.
prop lookout zone.id=lookout
prop lookout zone.radius=3
prop lookout zone.message=The lookout's deck on the rim. The whole town below you looks like a heap of toys in a bath.
prop council zone.id=council
prop council zone.radius=3
prop council zone.message=The council hulk: a long table, five chairs, a framed charter and a ballot box.
prop creak sound.event=event:/amb/wreck_creaks
prop creak sound.volume=0.5
prop creak zone.radius=35
prop hens creature.count=3
prop goats creature.count=2
prop turtles creature.count=2
prop dolphins creature.count=2

quest title=Five Votes
quest intro=A floating town of wrecks, its Council of Captains away at sea. The Council's notice is on the quay.
step reach|quay|1|Tie up at the town quay
step read|Notice of the Council|1|Read the Council's notice
step collect|story:springwater|1|Fill a cask at the crater spring on the north rim (Captain Mbeki)
step collect|story:vote|1|Pour it into Mbeki's water butt for her vote
step kill|Tangaroa rat|4|Clear the rats out of Captain Rourke's galley
step collect|story:vote|2|Take Rourke's vote from the galley's stove
step reach|sunkhull|1|Dive under Captain Yusuf's capsized hull
step collect|story:vote|3|Bring up Yusuf's strongbox for his vote
step collect|story:pumphandle|1|Find a pump handle in the scrap barge (Captain Ilka)
step collect|story:vote|4|Fit it and pump the Merrow dry for Ilka's vote
step reach|lookout|1|Climb the lookout tower on the east rim (Captain Fen)
step collect|story:vote|5|Bring Fen's spyglass back to his wheel for his vote
step reach|council|1|Go aboard the council hulk
step read|The Council's charter|1|Read the town's charter
step open|The town chest|1|Cast the five votes and open the town chest
quest done=Five votes of five: the first stranger the Council of Captains ever agreed on. The town creaks round you like applause.
quest reward=Cooked_Herring*3;Rope*4;Plank*6

save Sargasso Town

